:::callout{type=warning title="Quoted title with spaces"}
Attributes with a quoted value.
:::

:::callout{type=danger}
Attributes with only a bare (unquoted) value, no title.
:::

:::callout
No attributes at all — should fall back to the `info` type.
:::

:::callout{type=info collapsed}
A bare (valueless) attribute alongside a quoted one.
:::
